er Turn] You may trash 1 card from your hand: If your Leader has the {Land of Wano} or {Whitebeard Pirates} type, give up to 1 of your opponent's Leader or Characters −2000 power during this turn.","trigger":""},"EB01-003":{"effect":"[Rush] [When Attacking] If your opponent has 2 or less Life cards, this Character gains +2000 power during this turn.","trigger":""},"EB01-004":{"effect":"[When Attacking] You may give your active Leader −5000 power during this turn: Give up to 1 of your opponent's Characters −3000 power during this turn.","trigger":""},"EB01-005":{"effect":"","trigger":""},"EB01-006":{"effect":"[Blocker] [DON!! x2] [When Attacking] Give up to 1 of your opponent's Characters −3000 power during this turn.","trigger":""},"EB01-007":{"effect":"[Activate: Main] [Once Per Turn] Give up to 1 rested DON!! card to your Leader or 1 of your Characters.","trigger":""},"EB01-008":{"effect":"[Once Per Turn] If this Character would be K.O.'d by an effect, you may trash 1 Event or Stage from your hand instead.","trigger":""},"EB01-009":{"effect":"[Counter] Look at 5 cards from the top of your deck; play up to 1 {Animal} type Character with a cost of 3 or less. Then, place the rest at the bottom of your deck in any order.","trigger":""},"EB01-010":{"effect":"[Counter] K.O. up to 1 of your opponent's Characters with 6000 base power or less.","trigger":"[Trigger] K.O. up to 1 of your opponent's Characters with 5000 base power or less."},"EB01-011":{"effect":"[Activate: Main] You may rest this Stage and place 1 of your Characters with 1000 base power at the bottom of your deck: Draw 1 card.","trigger":""},"EB01-012":{"effect":"[On Play]/[When Attacking] If your Leader has the {Supernovas} type and you have no other [Cavendish] Characters, set up to 2 of your DON!! cards as active.","trigger":""},"EB01-013":{"effect":"[Activate: Main] You may trash this Character: Play up to 1 {Land of Wano} type Character with a cost of 5 or less other than [Kouzuki Hiyori] from your hand. Then, draw 1 card.","trigger":""},"EB01-014":{"effect":"[DON!! x1] [Your Turn] This Character gains +1000 power for every 3 of your rested DON!! cards.","trigger":""},"EB01-015":{"effect":"[On Play] Rest up to 1 of your opponent's Characters with a cost of 2 or less.","trigger":""},"EB01-016":{"effect":"[Activate: Main] You may rest this Character: K.O. up to 1 of your opponent's rested Characters with a cost of 1 or less.","trigger":""},"EB01-017":{"effect":"[Blocker]","trigger":""},"EB01-018":{"effect":"","trigger":""},"EB01-019":{"effect":"[Counter] Up to 1 of your Leader or Characters gains +4000 power during this battle. Then, look at 3 cards from the top of your deck; reveal up to 1 {Donquixote Pirates} type Character and add it to your hand. Then, place the rest at the bottom of your deck in any order.","trigger":""},"EB01-020":{"effect":"[Main] If your Leader has the {Supernovas} type, return 1 of your Characters to the owner's hand, and play up to 1 Character with a cost of 2 or less from your hand that is a different color than the returned Character.","trigger":"[Trigger] Activate this card's [Main] effect."},"EB01-021":{"effect":"[End of Your Turn] You may return 1 of your {Impel Down} type Characters with a cost of 2 or more to the owner's hand: Add up to 1 DON!! card from your DON!! deck and set it as active.","trigger":""},"EB01-022":{"effect":"[End of Your Turn] If you have 2 or less cards in your hand, draw 2 cards.","trigger":""},"EB01-023":{"effect":"[On Play] Draw 1 card.","trigger":""},"EB01-024":{"effect":"If you have 4 or less cards in your hand, all of your {SMILE} type Characters gain +1000 power.","trigger":""},"EB01-025":{"effect":"","trigger":""},"EB01-026":{"effect":"[DON!! x1] [When Attacking] If you have 1 or less cards in your hand, return up to 1 Character with a cost of 3 or less to the owner's hand.","trigger":""},"EB01-027":{"effect":"If your Leader's type includes \"Baroque Works\", this Character gains +1000 power for every 2 